{
  "name": "dsh-aurirlk-skills",
  "version": "0.6.0",
  "description": "Aurirlk 验证可用的 DSH（DeepSeek Harness）技能合集：每个技能一个目录，装上本包即注册全部技能。当前收录 15 个技能，包含 agent-trace-eval（Agent 工具调用轨迹评测三场景）、see-analyze-act（见析行三段式诊断）、visual-scene-judge（监控画面判别框架）、agent-orchestration（路由/记忆/人设编排）、nl2sql-analyst（自然语言问数）、speak-human（技术实现翻译成业务人话）、disk-butler（Windows 电脑管家）与 drawio（draw.io 图表生成 / 导出 / 体检）。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "skills",
    "README.md",
    "CONTRIBUTING.md",
    "SECURITY.md",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "ATTRIBUTIONS.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "agent-skill",
    "skills",
    "collection",
